<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., $29 mln seaport bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., $29 mln seaport bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIBC Municipal Securities said</p>
<p>Wednesday it repriced and restructured Dade County, Fla.'s</p>
<p>$29.1 million bond deal. The top yield was 5.70 percent in</p>
<p>2026.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>DADE COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $29,050,000*</p>
<p>SEAPORT REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1998		  460M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/1999		  480M    4.20  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2000		  500M    4.30  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2001		  520M    4.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2002		  540M    4.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2003		  565M    4.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2004		  595M    4.70  %	100.00</p>
