<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 97.138)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 10/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 27, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
